MotionLab uses third-party software and pretrained weights under their respective terms.

YOLOX: Megvii, https://github.com/Megvii-BaseDetection/YOLOX, Apache-2.0.
The ONNX decoder follows the official release's preprocessing and output conventions.
ByteTrack implementation: https://github.com/roboflow/trackers, Apache-2.0.
Supervision: https://github.com/roboflow/supervision, MIT.
SigLIP 2 weights: https://huggingface.co/google/siglip2-base-patch16-224, Apache-2.0.
Transformers, ONNX Runtime, PyTorch, OpenCV and FFmpeg retain their own licenses.

The optional example video is downloaded from Roboflow's published Supervision assets:
https://media.roboflow.com/supervision/video-examples/vehicles.mp4
It is not included in the source repository or used as an accuracy benchmark.
No ownership of that footage is claimed. Check media-specific rights before redistribution.
